03:4730 SGBPacket_PAL_TRN_StartupTransfer
03:4730 .data:0010
; PAL_TRN reads a 0x1000-byte VRAM payload via SendSGBTransferPacketStreamWithVRAMBufferFromBankedAddress.
; Kept conservative to avoid overlap with already-mapped symbols.
; Pan Docs layout for full 0x1000 payload: 512 palettes * 4 colors * 2 bytes = 4096 bytes.
; Colors are little-endian BGR15 words in VRAM transfer order.
